{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105192","id":2448551775,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6R8e9f","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105192","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105192.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105192.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105192","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105192/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105192/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105192/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e57427900ff57c5ecf316488854a5e13290a37c5","number":105192,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use non-recursive mutex for `StringName`, improving performance","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"~Requires https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105166 (mostly for code conflict convenience).~\r\n\r\nThis PR changes `StringName` to use a non-recursive mutex.\r\nNon-recursive mutexes are faster, so `StringName` creation is accelerated with this PR.\r\n\r\nNotably, the mutex is not the main bottleneck in `StringName` creation right now (cache misses are). But after the improvements from my other PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104372, the mutex lock could be pretty substantial (10-20%).\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\n\r\nThere was only one use requiring recursivity: `assign_static_unique_class_name`. This used the `StringName` mutex to avoid potential access conflicts of different threads trying to assign the static class name at the same time.\r\nThere is no need to use the `StringName` mutex for this, so I moved the functionality to `Object` instead (which is the only place it's used).\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\nI made an out-of-project benchmark for this, because I was interested in the raw performance difference. On my system (macOS arm64), non-recursive mutexes can apparently be 35% faster than recursive ones:\r\n```c++\r\n    std::mutex binary_mutex;\r\n    std::recursive_mutex recursive_mutex;\r\n\r\n    {\r\n        auto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < 100000000; i ++) {\r\n            // Test\r\n            std::unique_lock lock(binary_mutex);\r\n        }\r\n        auto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n        std::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n    }\r\n    {\r\n        auto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < 100000000; i ++) {\r\n            // Test\r\n            std::unique_lock lock(recursive_mutex);\r\n        }\r\n        auto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n        std::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis printed:\r\n```\r\n1435ms (binary mutex)\r\n2175ms (recursive mutex)\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/recei